    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While in your Avatar of the Archangel form, when you hit a creature with an attack, you can force it to make a Strength saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failure, it is Restrained until the end of your next turn as spectral chains lash around it. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of once).</p><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.0df36b8af8d93599]{Chains of Penitence}</li></ul>"
